---
import LegalLayout from '../../components/LegalLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../../data/content';
---
<LegalLayout
  eyebrow="Your data"
  title="Privacy policy"
  metaTitle={`Privacy policy — ${site.name}`}
  description="Privacy policy and personal data processing (GDPR) of TAMPLIER AUTO SOURCING."
>
  <p>
    {site.name} places particular importance on protecting your personal data and undertakes to
    process it in compliance with the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR) and the French
    Data Protection Act.
  </p>

  <h2>Data controller</h2>
  <p>
    The data controller is {site.name}, represented by {site.founder}. For any question relating
    to your data, contact <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>Data collected</h2>
  <p>
    Through the contact form, we only collect the data you provide voluntarily:
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>Name</li>
    <li>Email address</li>
    <li>Phone number (optional)</li>
    <li>Preferred package, budget and vehicle wanted (optional)</li>
    <li>The content of your message</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Purpose and legal basis</h2>
  <p>
    This data is used exclusively to respond to your request, prepare a quote and follow up on
    your car project. The legal basis for processing is your consent as well as the performance
    of pre-contractual measures taken at your request.
  </p>

  <h2>Retention period</h2>
  <p>
    Your data is kept for as long as necessary to process your request, then archived for a
    maximum of three years from the last contact, unless a legal obligation requires otherwise.
  </p>

  <h2>Recipients</h2>
  <p>
    Your data is neither sold nor transferred to third parties. It is processed by {site.founder}
    and, where applicable, by the technical provider handling the delivery of the form, strictly
    within the limits necessary for the service.
  </p>

  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <p>
    In accordance with the GDPR, you have the right to access, rectify, erase, restrict, object
    to and port your data. You may exercise these rights by writing to
    <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>. You also have the right to lodge a
    complaint with the French data protection authority, the CNIL
    (<a href="https://www.cnil.fr" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">www.cnil.fr</a>).
  </p>

  <h2>Cookies</h2>
  <p>
    This site is static and does not use advertising tracking cookies or third-party trackers.
    Only data strictly necessary for the proper functioning of the site may be used, without
    requiring consent.
  </p>
</LegalLayout>
